#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/update-troubleshooting.rst:27
#: dd695600c5e34a9a8dfd667b59283703
msgid "Lost internet access after a template update"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/update-troubleshooting.rst:30
#: 0b6e109ecc7e436f8e9c14bae0df6d7e
msgid ""
"In earlier versions of Qubes, there were situations where qubes lost "
"internet access after a template update. The following fix should be applied "
"in recent versions of Qubes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/update-troubleshooting.rst:32
#: 0651658761f24273b3f362b205a00960
msgid ""
"Run ``systemctl enable NetworkManager-dispatcher.service`` in the template "
"upon which your NetVM is based. You may have to reboot afterward for the "
"change to take effect. (**Note:** This is an upstream problem. See `this "
"Redhat ticket <https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=974811>`__). For "
"details, see the qubes-users mailing list threads `here <https://"
"groups.google.com/d/topic/qubes-users/xPLGsAJiDW4/discussion>`__ and `here "
"<https://groups.google.com/d/topic/qubes-users/uN9G8hjKrGI/discussion>`__.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/update-troubleshooting.rst:35
#: 633fe7a4ed8148c0a7e1668762b23831
msgid "Windows update is stuck"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/update-troubleshooting.rst:38
#: 2f2bb0cfe30c4ff2b249542435efee06
msgid ""
"This has nothing to do with Qubes. It’s a longstanding Windows bug. More "
"information about this issue and solutions can be found `here <https://"
"superuser.com/questions/951960/windows-7-sp1-windows-update-stuck-checking-"
"for-updates>`__."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/update-troubleshooting.rst:41
#: 949be924ca6d44d1bef367f89a9347f0
msgid "Dom0 and/or template update stalls when updating via the GUI tool"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/update-troubleshooting.rst:44
#: ad292da6a4d54a0284997cd542c2ae9b
msgid "This can usually be fixed by updating via the command line."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/update-troubleshooting.rst:46
#: 79c487f571c6493182e6de4c17a73e51
msgid "In dom0, open a terminal and run ``sudo qubes-dom0-update``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/troubleshooting/update-troubleshooting.rst:48
